		{"id":"4d2d3078bb53e131","x":-488,"y":-260,"width":1165,"height":430,"type":"text","text":"in between the Volstarian Dynasty and Askain lies a village called Xroas. During the rages of war, Xroas in the center of the chaos was first to be attacked. When (my character) was 9 the village was attacked by Askain slaughtering everyone in the village including (my character) family. (something happened) (my character) summons spectral blades to kill the people who killed my family but there were too many enemies so afterward decided to flee further in Volstarian Dynasty, while running (my character) hears voices in their head (god of domination and torture). Upon the way, being an orphaned peasant begging for change and food going from city to city along the way to the capital. When no one spared anything, thievery was the only way to live. Stealing was hard at first, getting caught every time but, with a small body escaping wasn’t too difficult. After many successful attempts of stealing, a human man named Edwin Harrison approached and asked me to join and said they could teach me the proper ways of a thief. After spending some time with him I started to learn more about this thieves guild and the level of trust between my mentor and the gifter. The name of this guild is “the seekers” and is a criminal organisation with the gifter as their leader and is the kind of man to give what you want if you do something. After getting good with thievery and making enough money to live through smuggling, and other sorts of small crime, aralia seeks more information on Asmodeus she went to the gifter for information but the gifter said price for the information is too high and to go prove herself first and so she left the seekers to find more about Asmodeus but to no avail this hunt for information eventually lead with teaming up with a party of adventurers\n\n\nFull tanker in entertainment district entrance password - I am here with presences\nFlaw- very attracted to shinies\nAralias connection with the raven queen is that i am hers and am fate-touched, there is no contract\n"}
